  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></math> is decreasing in domain <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6d1d452d-21f6-4392-b5d7-bdf699a69082.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 223px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></math> is continuous in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>≠</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></math> is not differentiable at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6fd6b6b8-f4b8-4c2c-af3f-e200e490e61a.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 257px;\"/></p>",
